        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-insistence-p06-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "你 / 让: 让/叫你X你就X: insist on compliance",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "让/叫你X你就X demands compliance with an instruction. It can sound forceful, so identify the relationship before using it.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "让你坐你就坐。",
                "pinyin": "ràng nǐ zuò nǐ jiù zuò 。",
                "meaning": "When you are told to sit, just sit.",
                "audio": "38feae93197bd60cb35f4b9599c91c8b3fa61b1956eb8f12db24d0ff9dc10cbc"
              },
              {
                "text": "叫你来你就来。",
                "pinyin": "jiào nǐ lái nǐ jiù lái 。",
                "meaning": "When you are told to come, just come.",
                "audio": "ff54eca4188f35ebdce9a7a56bb19d9d2fe0b0d5d4cecdcf81d1ff90b7c59f52"
              }
